  "instructions": [
    "Heat ghee or oil in a large wooden-board vessel over medium-high heat.",
    "Add onion and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add ginger and garlic and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add ground beef and cook until browned, breaking it up with a spoon as it cooks.",
    "Add allspice, cumin, coriander, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Stir in flour and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Gradually add water, stirring constantly, until the mixture comes to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer, covered, for 15 minutes.",
    "Stir in lemon juice and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped cilantro if desired."
  ],
